    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if they're using something as advanced as beamforming through the ionosphere, that's a huge amount of energy and coordination. it seems like it would be almost impossible to do that without being caught by anyone monitoring the spectrum. why would someone go to that much trouble just to send a signal into a single apartment?",
